---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import law from '../../generated/law.json';
---
<Base title="Severability" description="How the instrument decomposes when institutions start cutting, and what each cut costs.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Memorandum · strategy in public</p>
  <h1>Severability: what survives trimming</h1>
  <p class="intro prose">
    Most redistributive proposals at Union level die whole, at their
    weakest point. This document says in advance which parts of the
    Regulation stand on which legal basis, what the ask becomes at each
    stage of trimming, and in which order concessions run. Publishing it
    is a deliberate choice: hostile readers will quote it as lack of
    confidence, and the alternative is worse.
  </p>
  <div class="prose" set:html={law.severability} />
</Base>

<style>
  h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; margin: 0.4rem 0 1rem; }
  .intro { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
</style>
